  "body": "This brand-new standalone home featuring a spacious double garage is nestled in the highly sought-after Rangitoto College zone in one of the North Shore's most desirable suburbs.\r\n\r\nThe ground level centres on daily living and entertaining, featuring a dedicated entry that leads into a spacious family lounge and flows smoothly into the adjoining dining area and open-plan kitchen. A guest toilet on this floor adds extra everyday convenience, while the double garage provides secure parking, internal access, laundry facilities, and additional storage space. Upstairs, the primary bedroom features a private ensuite and a walk-in wardrobe, while three additional bedrooms share a family bathroom complete with a bathtub and separate shower. The entire layout is thoughtfully arranged for easy and organised everyday living.\r\n\r\nSituated at a prime Murrays Bay address, this property places you right in the heart of a vibrant North Shore community. Families will appreciate the access to prestigious local schools, including Murrays Bay School, Murrays Bay Intermediate, and Rangitoto College. Everyday convenience is exceptionally high with nearby village shops, cafes, public transport, local parks, reserves, and smooth connections to motorway links for easy commuting. Call us Today!",
